{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/courtyard-one-golden-light-dubai-south","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":1424,"crm_id":"7771","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":null,"title":"Courtyard One","slug":"courtyard-one-golden-light-dubai-south","display_address":"Dubai South","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Golden Light","price":1080000,"display_price":"1.08M","lattitude":24.944637721606,"longitude":55.210559167208,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Courtyard One is a boutique residential development located in the residential district of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/dubai-south/\">Dubai South</a>. Developed by Golden Light Real Estate Developments, this project presents a limited collection of just 47 exclusive residences. Courtyard One offers <strong>1 and 2-bedroom apartments, along with larger 2-bedroom residences</strong> featuring a dedicated study.</p><p>Courtyard One by Golden Light is designed around a central landscaped courtyard that serves as the heart of the community. It combines smart layouts with efficient space planning, offering unit sizes ranging from 760 sq. ft. to 1,225 sq.ft. Residents benefit from over 30 curated amenities, including a skyline-view swimming pool, yoga deck, jogging track, and dedicated kids’ areas. Positioned near Al Maktoum International Airport and key infrastructure hubs, Courtyard One for sale in Dubai presents a strategic opportunity within one of the city’s fastest-growing corridors.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Feature_803053a4ca.jpg","hash":"Feature_803053a4ca","name":"Feature.jpg"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Banner_754d603018.jpg","